---
---
<section class="section section-bg-dark" id="history">
  <!-- Baur's Line Drawing Watermark Graphic -->
  <div class="line-drawing-watermark"></div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="story-grid">
      <div class="story-content">
        <h2 class="heading-lg" style="color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;">
          Experience History & Creativity at Baur's Building
        </h2>
        <p style="color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-size: 1.05rem;">
          Originally built in 1891 as O.P. Baur's Confectionery, this historic building holds over a century of Denver craft and sweet memories. Baur's famous confections delighted generations—including inventing the ice cream soda!
        </p>
        <p style="color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 1.8rem; font-size: 1.05rem;">
          Today, Candy Factory Coworking preserves that rich heritage with exposed original brickwork, soaring wood beams, and warm natural light paired with ultra-fast gigabit fiber technology.
        </p>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem;">
          <button class="btn btn-teal" data-open-modal="Historic Building Tour">Schedule Building Tour</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="story-img-frame">
        <img src="https://candyfactorycoworking.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/1512-1514-Curtis-St-Denver-CO-Baurs-Building-1-LargeHighDefinition.jpg" alt="Historic Baur's Building Exterior Denver">
        <div class="story-badge">
          <h5>1514 Curtis Street</h5>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Theatre District & Central Business District</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.section-bg-dark {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.line-drawing-watermark {
  position: absolute;
  top: -10%;
  right: -5%;
  width: 600px;
  height: 600px;
  background-image: url('https://candyfactorycoworking.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/Baurs-Line-Drawing.png');
  background-size: contain;
  background-repeat: no-repeat;
  opacity: 0.08;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 0;
}

.story-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 4rem;
  align-items: center;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}

.story-img-frame {
  position: relative;
  border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg);
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
}

.story-img-frame img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 450px;
  object-fit: cover;
}

.story-badge {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 1.5rem;
  left: 1.5rem;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
  border-radius: var(--border-radius-md);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
}

.story-badge h5 {
  color: var(--dark-navy);
  font-size: 1.1rem;
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .story-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>
